{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ColorTubeFibers","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.shiftedCubic_eq_zero_of_cubic_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.shiftedCubic_eq_zero_of_cubic_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L48-L56","doc":"`𝐫 ∈ R_z` (i.e. `cubic 𝐫 = 0`) transports to a root of the shifted monic\ncubic at `X = 𝐫 + z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ColorTubeFibers.shift_to_elliptic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers.shift_to_elliptic","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L38-L46","doc":"The shift `𝐫 = X − z` (the map `X = 𝐜 + z` to the color elliptic fiber\n`𝓔_z`) turns the color-tube cubic into the monic cubic\n`X³ + (z+1)X² + (z²+z+1)X + (z³+z²+z+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ColorTubeFibers.cubic_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers.cubic_def","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Defining polynomial of the color tube. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ColorTubeFibers.cubic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers.cubic","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The color-tube cubic `P_z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ColorTubeFibers.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers.z","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L28-L28","doc":"The base point `z ∈ ℙ¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ColorTubeFibers.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ColorTubeFibers","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ColorTubeFibers","kind":"structure","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ColorTubeFibers.lean#L20-L34","doc":"Data for the color tube `R_z` at a point `z` (the same cubic defines the\n`G_z`, `B_z` tubes with the other resolvent coordinates).\n\nA `definition` carrier: the base point `z`, and the color-tube cubic\n`cubic` pinned to its manuscript polynomial. Membership `𝐫 ∈ R_z` is\n`cubic 𝐫 = 0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:color-tube-fibers","label":"def:color-tube-fibers","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-fibers.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}